{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04435","headline":"送别出塞 · 陈子昂","name":"送别出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生闻高义，书劒百夫雄。\n言登青云去，非此白头翁。\n胡兵屯塞下，汉骑属云中。\n君爲白马将，腰佩騂角弓。\n单于不敢射，天子伫深功。\n蜀山余方隐，良会何时同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}